itle=\"Selûnite Outpost\">Selûnite Outpost</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item can be combined with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Icy_Metal\" title=\"Icy Metal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Icy_Metal_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Icy_Metal\" title=\"Icy Metal\">Icy Metal</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Icy_Crystal\" title=\"Icy Crystal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Icy_Crystal_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <